Package: drasR
Type: Package
Title: Drift-Aware Risk-Guaranteed Acceptance Sampling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Muhammad Zahir", "Khan",
    email = "zahirstat007@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements drift-aware risk-guaranteed acceptance sampling
    methods for adaptive lot disposition. The package provides tools for
    classical acceptance sampling, producer-risk and consumer-risk
    assessment, exponentially weighted moving average drift monitoring,
    adaptive tightening policies, decision fragility analysis, and
    safety-cost Pareto frontier construction. The methods are intended for
    simulation studies, supplier quality monitoring, and audit-oriented
    inspection decision support.
